BT /F1 7 Tf 10.5 TL 28 812 Td (sla_policy.pdf) ' () ' (Remediation SLA policy) ' () ' (Clock. days_open of an exposure counts business days from the day after its publication date to 2025-09-30) ' (inclusive. The publication) ' (date is the local date of the publication instant in the zone of the service's region \(eu-west IE, us-central) ' (US, ap-south IN, ap-north JP, ap-southeast AU, global UTC\). A business day is a Monday to Friday that is) ' (not a holiday of the service's region and not inside an in-force change freeze window of the service) ' (\(change_freeze.ics; a window covers) ' (the UTC dates in [start, end\)\). days_open is null when the publication is unknown.) ' () ' (Targets. sla_days by severity and tier:) ' (critical: tier 0 7, tier 1 10, tier 2 15, tier 3 20 business days) ' (high: tier 0 15, tier 1 20, tier 2 30, tier 3 45 business days) ' (medium: tier 0 30, tier 1 45, tier 2 60, tier 3 90 business days) ' (low: tier 0 60, tier 1 90, tier 2 120, tier 3 180 business days) ' (none: tier 0 180, tier 1 180, tier 2 180, tier 3 180 business days) ' (An in-force override below for the service and severity with the latest effective date on or before 2025-09-30) ' (replaces the target.) ' (breach is true when days_open is greater than sla_days; it is false when days_open is null.) ' () ' (Holidays:) ' (eu-west: 2025-08-04) ' (us-central: 2025-07-04, 2025-09-01) ' (ap-south: 2025-08-15, 2025-09-17) ' (ap-north: 2025-07-21, 2025-08-11, 2025-09-15, 2025-09-23) ' (ap-southeast:) ' (global: 2025-07-14, 2025-08-25) ' () ' (Overrides) ' () ' (BATCH P001) ' (rid | rev | st | rec_at | service | severity | days | effective) ' (so-009248 | 1 | active | 2025-09-09 05:30:00 | svc-00303 | critical | 30 | 2025-09-27) ' (so-014035 | 1 | active | 2025-08-20 05:30:00 | svc-02028 | critical | 5 | 2025-09-11) ' (so-008826 | 1 | active | 2025-06-19 05:30:00 | svc-00151 | medium | 14 | 2025-07-18) ' (so-011194 | 1 | active | 2025-09-17 05:30:00 | svc-01005 | high | 21 | 202